      "title": "Image Corruption Evaluation for Visual Classification",
      "bullets": [
        "Implemented assigned image preprocessing routines in NumPy to apply brightness shifts and additive noise under a predefined evaluation protocol.",
        "Ran supplied classification baselines on corrupted images, checked label alignment, and summarized confusion patterns for review by the research team."
      ]
    }
  ],
